{"id":"u-8c7a15a3-4c64-4c81-852a-78cf645c6fc6","src":"community","title":"Modified Bro Split","author":"June G.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/dW52PK-modified-bro-split","desc":"Modified bro split so you don't overthink your lifting journey.\n\nTake most sets to 0-2 RIR if you don't know what that feels like occasionally take sets to failure preferably on isolation lifts.\n\nDon't worry about RPE just give it your all when lifting.\n\nFor progression:\nOnce you hit the top of the given rep  range in all of your sets acclimate yourself first for about a week or two before increasing weight don't go over the given rep range.\n\nIncrease weight slowly then repeat the process again.\n\nIf you feel that you're not recovering, are in a cut or simply not progressing reduce volume but maintin intensity.\n\nDon't add unnecessary volume right away try to fix sleep and diet first only then do you increase volume as needed try to feel if your body can handle more then decide accordingly.\n\nCheers and good luck.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-07T19:05:17.879Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Back Focus Day","Chest Focus Day","Leg Focus Day","Shoulder Focus Day","Arm Focus Day"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Neutral Grip, Bodyweight)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Kelso Shrug (Chest Supported)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Recline Curl","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Overhead Extension (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"One Arm Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"